    {
      "comment": "Summary card: \"AI uses Probability. Your Prompts Matter.\".",
      "speech": "So, to wrap up: AI \"thinks\" by using probability and statistics to predict the most likely next piece of information. And you have a powerful role in shaping its responses by crafting clear, detailed, and specific prompts.",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>Bullets with Image</title>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Semi+Condensed:wght@600&family=Figtree:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    /* ── Boilerplate: do not modify ── */\n    :root {\n      font-size: calc(16vh / 9); /* 1rem = 16px at design height of 900px; scales with viewport */\n      --color-teal:           #0093A4;\n      --color-purple:         #8C52BA;\n      --color-aqua:           #3CFFF7; /* AI features only */\n      --color-error:          #E02D16;\n      --color-warning:        #F9CB28;\n      --color-success:        #3EA33E;\n      --color-info:           #1892E3;\n      --color-text-primary:   #292F36;\n      --color-text-secondary: #4C5661;\n      --color-gray-light:     #F7F8FA;\n      --color-gray-medium:    #D1D4D8;\n      --color-gray-dark:      #5F6872;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    html, body {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-family: 'Figtree', sans-serif;\n      background: var(--color-gray-light);\n      color: var(--color-text-primary);\n    }\n    /* ── End boilerplate ── */\n\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .header {\n      height: 8.75rem;\n      padding: 0 4rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      background: var(--color-gray-light);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease both;\n    }\n\n    .heading {\n      font-family: 'Barlow Semi Condensed', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 4rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--color-text-primary);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      border-left: 0.5rem solid var(--color-teal);\n      padding-left: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .main {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 3rem;\n      padding: 2rem 4rem 3rem;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Left column: bullets */\n    .col-bullets {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: center;\n      animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease 0.1s both;\n    }\n\n    .bullets {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .bullets li {\n      font-family: 'Barlow Semi Condensed', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 3.25rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--color-text-primary);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      border-left: 0.375rem solid var(--color-purple);\n      padding-left: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Right column: portrait image */\n    .col-image {\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease 0.15s both;\n    }\n\n    /* Shown when no image is provided — replace with <img class=\"image\"> */\n    .image-placeholder {\n      height: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;\n      background: var(--color-gray-medium);\n      border: 0.1875rem dashed var(--color-gray-dark);\n      border-radius: 1rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 1.125rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: 0.125rem;\n      color: var(--color-gray-dark);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    }\n\n    /* Applied to <img> after replacing the placeholder */\n    .image {\n      height: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border-radius: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; }\n      to   { opacity: 1; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1 class=\"heading\">Generic Prompts</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"col-bullets\">\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>Vague requests</li>\n        <li>Broad responses</li>\n        \n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-image\">\n      <img src=\"/generation/units/aif1-v2-2025/lessons/lesson-1-talking-to-machines/videos/how-ai-thinks/images/generated_image_4107f8ee-5bb8-42d5-aa30-7cc6c65ef78e.png\" alt=\"A simple AI chat interface showing a generic prompt 'Give me 3 gift ideas' and a very general response.\" class=\"image\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"
